        "readme": "\n## Validation\n\nRequest bodies are validated with [Zod](https://zod.dev). See `validators/example.validator.js` for the pattern, and `middlewares/validate.js` for the `validateWith(schema)` middleware.\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}
